+# CONTRACT — Multi-tenant Analytics Dashboard API
+
+## Auth & User Management
+- [ ] POST /api/auth/register creates user + token -> 201 with `{token, user}`, user has id/email/tenantId/role
+- [ ] Register without tenantId creates new tenant, role=admin -> user.role === 'admin'
+- [ ] Register with existing tenantId joins it, default role=viewer
+- [ ] Duplicate email register -> 409
+- [ ] Register missing email/password -> 400
+- [ ] POST /api/auth/login with valid creds -> 200 `{token, user}`
+- [ ] Login wrong password -> 401
+- [ ] Login unknown email -> 401
+- [ ] GET /api/me returns own profile (auth) -> 200, no password_hash leaked
+- [ ] GET /api/me without token -> 401
+- [ ] PATCH /api/users/:id/role by admin in same tenant -> 200 updated role
+- [ ] PATCH role by non-admin -> 403
+- [ ] PATCH role on user in different tenant -> 404
+- [ ] PATCH role invalid role value -> 400
+- [ ] GET /api/users lists tenant users only (auth)
+
+## Data Ingestion
+- [ ] POST /api/events with {name, properties?, timestamp?} -> 201 with event, tenant_id = caller's tenant
+- [ ] POST /api/events missing name -> 400
+- [ ] POST /api/events/batch {events:[...]} -> 201 with count, all events tenant-scoped
+- [ ] Ingestion without auth -> 401
+- [ ] Events isolated by tenant (cannot see other tenant's events via query)
+
+## Query Engine
+- [ ] POST /api/query/count {name?,from?,to?,filters?} -> {count} only of own tenant
+- [ ] count with name filter only counts matching event name
+- [ ] count with property filter matches properties
+- [ ] POST /api/query/timeseries {interval,name?,from?,to?} -> {buckets:[{bucket,count}]}
+- [ ] POST /api/query/breakdown {property,name?} -> {breakdown:[{value,count}]} grouped by property
+- [ ] Queries without auth -> 401
+- [ ] Query of tenant A never returns tenant B data
+
+## Dashboards
+- [ ] POST /api/dashboards {name,config?} -> 201, tenant-scoped, owner=caller
+- [ ] GET /api/dashboards lists own tenant dashboards
+- [ ] GET /api/dashboards/:id returns dashboard (own tenant) else 404
+- [ ] PUT /api/dashboards/:id updates name/config -> 200
+- [ ] DELETE /api/dashboards/:id -> 204, gone after
+- [ ] Dashboard of other tenant -> 404 on get/update/delete
+- [ ] Dashboard routes without auth -> 401
+
+## Export
+- [ ] GET /api/export/events?format=json -> JSON array of tenant events
+- [ ] GET /api/export/events?format=csv -> text/csv with header row
+- [ ] GET /api/export/dashboards/:id?format=json -> dashboard JSON
+- [ ] GET /api/export/dashboards/:id?format=csv -> csv
+- [ ] Export without auth -> 401
+- [ ] Export only own tenant data
+
+## Build/Lint
+- [ ] `npm run build` compiles clean (strict, Node16)
+- [ ] `npm run lint` passes
+- [ ] `createApp` exported from src/index.ts returning Express app
+- [ ] Tests pass (vitest)
